config SUNXI_DECD
	tristate "Allwinner H726 /dev/decd decoder ABI"
	depends on SYNC_FILE
	select DMABUF
	help
	  Userspace contract for the H726 hardware composer's decoder display
	  device (/dev/decd).  The vendor ships no H726 driver and no register
	  interface survives, so this implements the five proven ioctls with
	  defined behaviour rather than claiming hardware decode.
